# To Catch a Falling Star (windurst 53) with a full inventory (accepted by a GM). The Twinkle Tree at 00:00: the scales:
# the two messages; npcUtil.giveItem refuses the tear (ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED), nothing taken, prog 0; with room: the
# tear, the scales taken, prog 1. Sigismund with the inventory full again: the tear: 199; its finish takes the tear
# first (player:tradeComplete), so the Fish Scale Shield (player:addItem, no space check) fits: completed, prog 2.
char zone=WestSarutabaruta pos=154.5,-40.75,333.7 job=WAR lvl=75
item HandfulOfPugilScales x2
login
quest Windurst.ToCatchAFallingStar accepted
wait vana=12                            # 00:00
fill-inventory
trade Twinkle_Tree HandfulOfPugilScales x1  # full: the two messages; ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED; nothing taken; prog 0
free-inventory
trade Twinkle_Tree HandfulOfPugilScales x1  # the two messages; the Starfall Tear; the scales taken; prog 1
warp -109.04,-9.0,80.56 PortWindurst    # beside Sigismund
fill-inventory
trade Sigismund StarfallTear x1         # accepted, the tear alone: 199
finish                                  # the tear taken; completed; fame 20; the Fish Scale Shield fits; prog 2
